"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Secondary trends last about 3 weeks to 3 months and retrace 1/3 to 2/3 of the primary move."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aAHlf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 493.3333333333333, "y": 509, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-1c", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-13", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 204, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Renko", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fixed price moves (\"bricks\"), not time intervals. Trend clarity, momentum; smooths minor moves; suits trailing stops."}]}]}}, "index": "a95Ar", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1779, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-2d", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-1e", "props": {"w": 97.27047146401985, "h": 150, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tools", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aZzGy", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-3e", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch15-3a", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pauses within a trend, usually followed by a breakout. The drawn diagrams are on this chapter's web page."}]}]}}, "index": "a4QaE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 821.1346153846154, "y": 1010, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-h", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-3", "props": {"w": 522.8653846153845, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "violet", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fundamental", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aEg3b", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 328.3116883116883, "y": 1378, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-4f", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-3n", "props": {"w": 611.2207792207793, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Round numbers act as barriers"}]}]}}, "index": "aS9Kz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 554, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-5g", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch15-59", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Also called the Relative Strength Indicator or Price Relative Indicator. A "}, {"type": "text", "text": "ratio chart", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " comparing one security with another, such as a stock against the Nifty 50 or its sector."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Use about a "}, {"type": "text", "text": "5 to 6 year", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " period. Normalised to "}, {"type": "text", "text": "100", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": above 100 means outperforming the benchmark; below 100, underperforming."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A good buy: RSC below 100 for a long time, then turning up and crossing 100."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "a7Blr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1040, "y": 550, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-6h", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch15-66", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "8.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Tertiary trends: usually under 3 weeks."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aBW62", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 930.6666666666666, "y": 509, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-1d", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-13", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 204, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Heikin-Ashi", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Adjusted candles that "}, {"type": "text", "text": "average", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " price data to cut noise. Trend following; keeps traders in longer by filtering whipsaws."}]}]}}, "index": "aAulb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 161.27047146401986, "y": 1779, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-2e", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-1e", "props": {"w": 277.2208436724565, "h": 150, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "50 or 100-day moving averages, trendlines, MACD, higher highs and lows"}]}]}}, "index": "aadVb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 294, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-3f", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch15-3a", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Three triangles"}]}]}}, "index": "a5BsA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1096, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-i", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-3", "props": {"w": 244.6153846153846, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Focus", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aFRoQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 947.5324675324675, "y": 1378, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-4g", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-3n", "props": {"w": 396.46753246753235, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Nifty 25,000"}]}]}}, "index": "aTILz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 754, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-5h", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch15-59", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "15.9.6 OBV (On Balance Volume)"}]}]}}, "index": "a8aJX", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 878, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-6i", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch15-66", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "9.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Hanging man: bearish, after an up move, needs a lower close next. Hammer: bullish, after a decline. Shadow at least twice the body."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aCYrA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 0, "y": 3631.6, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-1e", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 2254.600000000006, "name": "15.3 Dow Theory", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a33QM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 446.4913151364764, "y": 1779, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-2f", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-1e", "props": {"w": 364.7642679900744, "h": 150, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fibonacci retracement (38.2%, 50%, 61.8%), trendlines, 50 DMA, volume, RSI or stochastic"}]}]}}, "index": "abOgA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 369, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-3g", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-3a", "props": {"w": 413.3333333333333, "h": 444, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Either way", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Symmetrical triangle", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Consolidation before a forced breakout or breakdown"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Break above the upper line: new bullish trend. Below the lower line: new bearish trend"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book says it is also known as a wedge pattern"}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "a6G46", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 308.61538461538464, "y": 1096, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-j", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch15-3", "props": {"w": 504.51923076923066, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Price action and market behaviour"}]}]}}, "index": "aGoeE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1482, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-4h", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch15-3n", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Breakout:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " price moves decisively beyond the level "}, {"type": "text", "text": "with volume", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". "}, {"type": "text", "text": "False breakout:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " a brief breach that quickly reverses, trapping traders. Volume and candlestick confirmation help tell them apart."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Strength of a level:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " more touches, higher volume at the level, more time spent near it, and more recent levels all make it stronger."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Uses:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " bounce trades (buy near support, sell near resistance), breakout trades, pullback entries on a retest, and stop-losses just below support or above resistance."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Limits:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " levels are zones, not exact prices; drawing them is subjective; in strong trends they are respected less; news can override them."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Advanced ideas:", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " order blocks, liquidity pools (where stop orders cluster), VWAP and anchored VWAP."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aUD1E", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 829, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-5i", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch15-59", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Add the day's volume to a running total if the close is higher than yesterday's; subtract it if lower."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "OBV should rise with prices and fall with them. In a divergence, volume often "}, {"type": "text", "text": "leads", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " price, warning of a reversal."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Read OBV 1 (the line) with OBV 20 (its 20-period average). Buy when OBV 1 crosses above a rising OBV 20; sell when it crosses below a falling OBV 20."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A pronounced weakening of OBV on long-term charts can mean "}, {"type": "text", "text": "smart money is quietly exiting", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". A higher high in price without a higher OBV: buying pressure is fading."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The book's example: Maharashtra Scooters' weekly OBV turned up from May 2023, and the stock delivered about 4 times from there."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "a9vSU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 878, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch15-6j", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch15-66", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "10.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Bullish engulfing: stronger after four or more red candles. Only real bodies count."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aD7xM", "typeName": "shape"}]}